{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared validation contract. Read by tests/workflowValidation.test.mjs and by",
    "tests/python/test_worker_graph_workflows.py so the editor and the runtime cannot disagree about",
    "whether a workflow may run.",
    "",
    "`expect.ts` is the rule code getWorkflowValidationRuleCode() must report; `expect.python` is",
    "the rule the runtime must reject with. null means 'accepted'.",
    "",
    "The two sides are allowed to differ only where the difference is a division of labour:",
    "  - batch_input_* is frontend-only. The folder is expanded into tasks before the worker is",
    "    called, so an empty folder simply produces no tasks and the runtime never sees it.",
    "  - missing_core_node is runtime-only. readWorkflowGraphDefinition() restores a missing",
    "    input/save node on read, so the editor can never observe one.",
    "Every other rule must match exactly."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a complete linear workflow runs",
      "expect": { "ts": null, "python": null },
      "definition": {
        "version": 2,
        "kind": "pymss-studio-graph",
        "defaults": { "device": "auto", "output_format": "wav", "model_dir": null, "inference_params": { "normalize": false } },
        "graph": {
          "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "k": 1 },
          "nodes": [
            { "id": "input", "type": "input_audio", "position": { "x": 72, "y": 210 }, "data": {} },
            { "id": "step_1", "type": "separate", "position": { "x": 384, "y": 118 }, "data": { "model": "a.ckpt", "stems": ["vocals", "instrument"] } },
            { "id": "save", "type": "save_outputs", "position": { "x": 900, "y": 192 }, "data": { "outputs": { "step_1.vocals": "vocals" } } }
          ],
          "edges": [
            { "id": "e1", "source": { "nodeId": "input", "portId": "audio" }, "target": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "input" } },
            { "id": "e2", "source": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "stem:vocals" }, "target": { "nodeId": "save", "portId": "save:step_1.vocals" } }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a two step chain runs",
      "expect": { "ts": null, "python": null },
      "definition": {
        "version": 2,
        "kind": "pymss-studio-graph",
        "defaults": { "device": "auto", "output_format": "wav", "model_dir": null, "inference_params": { "normalize": false } },
        "graph": {
          "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "k": 1 },
          "nodes": [
            { "id": "input", "type": "input_audio", "position": { "x": 72, "y": 210 }, "data": {} },
            { "id": "step_1", "type": "separate", "position": { "x": 384, "y": 118 }, "data": { "model": "a.ckpt", "stems": ["vocals", "instrument"] } },
            { "id": "step_2", "type": "separate", "position": { "x": 702, "y": 214 }, "data": { "model": "b.ckpt", "stems": ["vocals"] } },
            { "id": "save", "type": "save_outputs", "position": { "x": 1100, "y": 192 }, "data": { "outputs": { "step_2.vocals": "vocals" } } }
          ],
          "edges": [
            { "id": "e1", "source": { "nodeId": "input", "portId": "audio" }, "target": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "input" } },
            { "id": "e2", "source": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "stem:vocals" }, "target": { "nodeId": "step_2", "portId": "input" } },
            { "id": "e3", "source": { "nodeId": "step_2", "portId": "stem:vocals" }, "target": { "nodeId": "save", "portId": "save:step_2.vocals" } }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an edge from a node that does not exist is rejected",
      "expect": { "ts": "dangling_connection", "python": "dangling_connection" },
      "definition": {
        "version": 2,
        "kind": "pymss-studio-graph",
        "defaults": { "device": "auto", "output_format": "wav", "model_dir": null, "inference_params": { "normalize": false } },
        "graph": {
          "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "k": 1 },
          "nodes": [
            { "id": "input", "type": "input_audio", "position": { "x": 72, "y": 210 }, "data": {} },
            { "id": "step_1", "type": "separate", "position": { "x": 384, "y": 118 }, "data": { "model": "a.ckpt", "stems": ["vocals"] } },
            { "id": "save", "type": "save_outputs", "position": { "x": 900, "y": 192 }, "data": { "outputs": { "step_1.vocals": "vocals" } } }
          ],
          "edges": [
            { "id": "e1", "source": { "nodeId": "input", "portId": "audio" }, "target": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "input" } },
            { "id": "e2", "source": { "nodeId": "step_1", "portId": "stem:vocals" }, "target": { "nodeId": "save", "portId": "save:step_1.vocals" } },
            { "id": "ghost", "source": { "nodeId": "does_not_exist", "portId": "audio" }, "target": { "nodeId": "save", "portId": "save:ghost" } }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a stem the model does not produce is rejected",
      "expect": { "ts": "invalid_port", "python": "invalid_port" },
      "definition": {
        "version": 2,
        "kind": "pymss-studio-graph",
        "defaults": { "device": "auto", "output_format": "wav", "model_dir": null, "inference_params": { "normalize": false } },
